notes.content:
Features:
Added stage 8 and 9 on Challenge Mode;

Bugs:
Fixed bug in Challenge Mode where projectiles were not destroyed when resetting the stage;

New:
Added solo game mode (Challenge). Tracks where you must destroy all targets in the shortest time possible. Your time will be placed on a leaderboard;

Changes:
The Tank's smoke bomb now deals damage;
The Mech's ultimate fixed;

Buffs:
The Tank;
The Fish;
The Nave;
The Spider;

Nerfs:
The Ship;
The Drill;

Added tank "The Mech";
Added mechanics for breaking scenery objects;
Balanced tank power and cooldown;
